5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good evening. I value a quiet start to our discussion.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I hope we can find the bad guys quickly!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's observe carefully. Panic leads to mistakes. Stay calm.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello. I’m Midori. I’ll listen to everyone’s concerns.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I’m Takumi. Let’s not waste time. Who’s suspicious?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Mizuki. Observation is key before judgment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,I agree! But I want to know who is lying!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Rin, your enthusiasm is noted. Let’s wait for more data.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I support a balanced approach. Let’s hear more from Takumi.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I’m just asking questions. Why is everyone so quiet?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Silence can be a shield. I prefer to think deeply.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Thinking is good, but action is better! Let’s talk!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Action without thought is dangerous. We need evidence first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I feel a tension here. Let’s keep it friendly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Friendly? This is a game of survival. Wake up.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will remain calm. The truth will reveal itself.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, I’ll be calm. But I’m still watching you all!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Good. Let’s end the day with clear heads.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,Thank you all. I hope we find harmony in our search.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,We’ll see. Night falls. Let’s see who blinks.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
